#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Exercise unwound behind the real fence, on Linux, end to end.

Usage: python3 test/check-unwound FENCE UNWOUND
The binaries must be Linux builds for this machine. Everything runs in private
mount and network namespaces, as root; nothing on the host changes. A fixture
resolver in a peer namespace answers, stays silent, forges and truncates on
cue, and records every question that reaches it.
"""
